Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:04.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Energy gets wasted for a boring reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:06.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,nobody trusts the forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:09.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,In September, I built Agentic Arbiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:18.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,They run chillers even when the air outside is cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:24.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,So it decides, each hour, when switching them off is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it made no unsafe calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:29.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,The old controller made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:32.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it grades itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:36.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it missed its target, and says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:41.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second of eight hundred and forty-two teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:44.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,The UN-backed Cool Coalition featured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:48.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, I want it running on real sites.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then I looked at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:56.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pakistan has solar everywhere, but the grid cannot see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,I asked twenty-one families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:01.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Seven of the ten with solar have changed habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:07.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I am building a Solar Home Agent for those homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:10.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go over two hundred units,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:12.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,and every unit costs more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,It keeps this home under that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:17.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Five thousand rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.22,0:01:21.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,It picks when to run the motor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.53,0:01:22.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,and says why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:28.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thirteen said they would only trust an app that explains itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:32.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,So when it is not sure, it says no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:34.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,and tells you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:38.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,It still wastes most of its midday sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:39.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Storage closes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:43.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is a simulation, with every assumption written down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:48.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next, five to ten homes in Islamabad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:51.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then one neighbourhood forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The solar is already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:57.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want the grid to trust it.
